# summary-promotion-field.must-fail.patch
#
# Targets: tests/Playwright/e2e/e2e-tests/checkout/summary-promotion-field.spec.ts
# — "The promotion-code field the checkout supplies appears inside the itemised
# summary" (C19, C20).
# Authored by: developer seat (agent-seat-separation.companion.md — the seat that
# knows the exact line it changed authors the mutant; the prover applies it
# blind, confirms RED, then reverts — never reading src to construct it).
#
# Mutates ONE line: removes the itemised region's own <BasketPromotions> from
# Summary.vue. This is the line that actually delivers the capability — the
# summary renders the promotions form itself, gated on `showPromotions`, which
# CheckoutPricing.vue passes as `uischema.showPromotionsOnCheckout`. Dropping it
# renders nothing and throws nothing, which is exactly why this needs a test.
#
# NOTE: an earlier revision of this control removed the trailing `<slot />`
# instead, on the premise that CheckoutPricing.vue passed its own
# <BasketPromotions> as slot content. That stopped being true when the promotions
# render moved inside Summary.vue — CheckoutPricing.vue's <Summary /> is now
# self-closing and passes no slot content, so the old mutant could not fail:
# the assertion was satisfied by the summary's own copy either way.
#
# Expected RED: 1 of 3.
#   - "…appears inside the itemised summary": the promotions-form count inside
#     the breakdown falls 1 → 0, and so does the whole-step count.
#
# VERIFIED 2026-08-19 (chrome, this spec only):
#   baseline        3 passed          exit 0
#   mutant applied  1 failed 2 passed exit 1
#     → expect(getByTestId('basket-summary-breakdown')
#              .getByTestId('promotions-form')).toHaveCount(1)
#       Expected: 1  Received: 0   (spec:107)
#   reverted        tree byte-identical to the green baseline
# Still GREEN, correctly — neither renders the itemised branch:
#   - "…still offered once when the checkout summary shows plain totals" renders
#     the plain-totals branch's own copy, which this patch leaves intact.
#   - "No promotion-code field is offered at checkout when the brand withholds
#     it" asserts zero fields, which a dropped render also satisfies.
#
# Apply / verify / revert:
#   git apply <this file>                          # mutate
#   pnpm exec playwright test tests/Playwright/e2e/e2e-tests/checkout/summary-promotion-field.spec.ts
#   git apply -R <this file>                       # revert — must return to green
#
--- a/packages/client-vue/src/modules/basket/components/Summary.vue
+++ b/packages/client-vue/src/modules/basket/components/Summary.vue
@@ -187,7 +187,6 @@

       <!-- the promotions form and any trailing content sit inside the summary's
            own sections so they share their spacing -->
-      <BasketPromotions v-if="props.showPromotions" />
       <slot />
     </div>

